  "findings": [
    "Contact identity by configured field SQL conjunction; not file/image content dedup. Selected provided configured fields used, missing configured keys do not enforce full identity. Values not normalized here; DB collation influences equality. Query excludes empty/null matching fields, candidate entities ordered dateAdded DESC/id DESC; core ContactDeduper merge behavior external dependency unreviewed.",
    "Fields.hasNotEmptyFieldsToSkip ignores actual value and checks settings skipFields indexed by input alias; getFieldsToSkip returns settings array for value iteration. Config representation must be traced through integration to qualify apparent mismatch. Source-only, no runtime claim.",
    "Command delegates deduplicate to external Mautic ContactDeduper, lock/status inherited, optional merge direction. Disabled and already-running return0; no per-contact result/completeness contract here. Background command dispatch controller immediately reports launch, not completion; no process handle/status read or timeout shown. Never executed, no CRM/contact changes or notification sent.",
    "Seven additional whole files read. Form declares uniqueFields and skipFields as multiple LeadFieldsType; exact submitted shape determined by external Mautic form type, unavailable here. Source inconsistency retained: uniqueData checks in_array values but skip input check indexes skipFields by alias and ignores actual value. No PHP execution, not claimed runtime reproduction.",
    "README contract says all configured fields must duplicate; implementation iterates only provided query fields so absent configured fields reduce conjunction. End-to-end importance depends on external event fields completeness. Skip filtering also applied to candidate SQL. Listener runs only when command constant defined, then sets event duplicates even nullable return. External event setter contract unqualified.",
    "Composer only declares mautic/composer-plugin^1.0; no lockfile/test files in15blob inventory. Typed PHP properties and mixed Symfony translator interfaces constrain compatibility beyond manifest. README requires external Mautic PR9844; no external PR source credited as reviewed. Three external user-images screenshots remain unviewed; tracked icon and license pending. No composer install, background dispatch, notification or CRM changes."
